One thing I've never liked is how nethack handles spells (I like
it better in 3.1.1, but it's still not very good IMO).  The other
thing is that there really isn't any use for gems except for 
throwing at unicorns and extra points.

My idea:  get rid of energy points, limited spell uses, and rereadable
books.  Compare the char. level with 3 times the spell level -3 to
see if the char. can cast the spell.  Associate a gem with each
spell.  Every time you cast a spell, it destroys the corresponding
gem in your inventory.  


